{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/456406-entering-twilight-form-power-how-would-you-do-it","id":456406,"title":"Entering Twilight Form Power: How would you do it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-24T18:07:19-07:00","id":456406,"title":"Entering Twilight Form Power: How would you do it?","content":"Just like the title says, I was wondering, how would you work a Demonic Form power that allows you to enter a Frequency of the Twilight? I think that, while it might work as a Propulsion, it probably would end up as a Process. I was think one Aether and an Instant action might work, but should it involve a roll? Or would you do something different altogether?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:19:16-07:00","id":456519,"title":"","content":"Maybe take a look at the 'phase' propulsion. A cost to phase through then cost to aid back.<br /> <br /> Or operate more as 'data form' with a cost to remain in that frequency.<br /> <br /> At least that is about all I could suggest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T21:42:33-07:00","id":456566,"title":"","content":"I'd make it an Exploit and call it &quot;Switch Frequency&quot; but that's about all I've got.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T08:00:31-07:00","id":456871,"title":"","content":"Alright, here are my attempts at the concept both in Exploit and Process form.<br /> <br /> Frequency Modulator<br /> While the Angels of the Machine possess their own unique frequency of the state of existence named by mortal occultist as &quot;the Twilight&quot;, sometimes they need to properly interact with beings such as Spirits or Ghosts. Those with this Process may transition to a non-native frequency, allowing them to deal with such beings on even terms.<br /> <br /> APPEARANCE: Small tuning fork shaped protrusions jut out from the outcast's joints.<br /> <br /> SYSTEMS: Chose a single Frequency of Twilight(for example, the Frequency used by ghosts, or the one used by Spirits), with the sole exception of the Angelic Frequency. The Unchained may pay 1 Aether as an instant action in order to access the state of Twilight for the rest of the scene. While in this state, they are invisible and intangible to anything they do not share a Frequency with. Those things they may interact with normally. In order to return to normal before the scene is up, they must pay another point of Aether as a reflexive action. They may do the same thing to extend the transition for another scene.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T09:12:33-07:00","id":456942,"title":"","content":"Shift Frequency<br /> There are more realms of existence than the physical, and the Machine has created Angels to to reach them all. This Exploit allows for the comparatively humble ability to access an area of the mortal plane most are unable to touch, allowing the user to travel to the Twilight and back.<br /> <br /> Example Prerequisites: Deep Cover, Wave Function Collapse<br /> <br /> Dice Pool: Dexterity+Occult+Primum<br /> <br /> Action: Instant<br /> <br /> Cost: 3 Aether <br /> <br /> ROLL RESULTS<br /> <br /> Dramatic Failure: Not only does the Unchained fail to transition, the botched attempt scrambles their own quantum wavelength, granting them a transitory glitch(roll Primum to determine severity as usual).<br /> <br /> Failure: The outcast remains in their current state of existence.<br /> <br /> Success: The Unchained alters their quantum wavelength, entering the state of Twilight or returning to the material state. When they transition to a state of Twilight, they must chose a frequency(as of this writing, the Dead Frequency, Spiritual Frequency, Projected Frequency, and Angelic Frequency). While in this state, they are invisible and intangible to creatures who do not occupy the same frequency as them. <br /> <br /> Exceptional Success: As success, but the outcast can take up to (Primum) allies with him when he transitions. These allies must be in physical contact with you when you translate yourself. Unless they have the ability to make such transitions on their own, however, it is wise to have some sort of backup plan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3514,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","user":"ZealousChristian24","date":".  Fixed some issues 03-25-2015, 02:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T10:16:05-07:00","id":457025,"title":"","content":"I like the idea. But if you can bring allies they should need to be so close to you or risk being lost or coming back to material. <br /> <br /> I also feel you should also make mention of how to return. So maybe add the option &quot;or back to the material world&quot; in the activation if you don't want a time limit.<br /> <br /> After a bit of thought, isn't this also just a very focused 'rip the gates'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T10:49:02-07:00","id":457053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/456406-entering-twilight-form-power-how-would-you-do-it?p=457025#post457025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the idea. But if you can bring allies they should need to be so close to you or risk being lost or coming back to material.<br /> <br /> I also feel you should also make mention of how to return. So maybe add the option &quot;or back to the material world&quot; in the activation if you don't want a time limit.<br /> <br /> After a bit of thought, isn't this also just a very focused 'rip the gates'?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes and no. &quot;Twilight&quot; isn't a place, it's a state of existence. Another way to put it is that Twilight is &quot;out of phase&quot; with normal reality, but exists in the same location. A bit like how you and another person can occupy the same place at different points in time, but insead of separation by time, there's separation by a different spatial dimension.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T11:42:08-07:00","id":457088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr.F.I.X.</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/456406-entering-twilight-form-power-how-would-you-do-it?p=457025#post457025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I like the idea. But if you can bring allies they should need to be so close to you or risk being lost or coming back to material. <br /> <br /> I also feel you should also make mention of how to return. So maybe add the option &amp;quot;or back to the material world&amp;quot; in the activation if you don't want a time limit.<br /> <br /> After a bit of thought, isn't this also just a very focused 'rip the gates'?</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you for your commentary. I've tried to address your concerns. As for Twilight, it's like a alternate state of being, the way ghosts and spirits that have entered our world naturally are. It's the same song, but in a different key.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-26T19:23:04-07:00","id":458575,"title":"","content":"Only tangentially related to the topic, but you can go into Twilight while using a spirit or ghost as your cover, if you're just looking for a way to pull this off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}